        "id": 1297255
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-06T22:57:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the original implementation, transitionTo does not check if the input destState is null. The StateMachine determines if it needs to change state by checking if the stored mDestState is null or not. \n\nSo my assumption on this is that, transitionTo allows a null value destState. Then if we replace mDestState by mDestination, we determines if there is a state transition by looking at if mDestination is null or not.\n\nThe original transitionTo() implementation also has a bug that when the destState is null and mDbg is true, mDestState.getName() will throw NPE.\n\nI\u0027m also not sure if we should prohibit passing in a null value destState and what should we do to support that. Do you Log.wtf and then continue ?",
      "parentUuid": "0c3c93fa_523b834e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1278,
        "startChar": 42,
        "endLine": 1278,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "a283c12512af5783ff7876d2ef76a681e886ea55",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7feb1d1d_0cde79d0",
        "filename": "core/java/com/android/internal/util/StateMachine.java",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 1278,
      "author": {
        "id": 1297255
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-06T22:57:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this StateMachine will support other implementations that did not extend State because addState() only takes State as input. The StateInfo also keyed by State. It means during state transition, the IState type destination state has be cast to State to find out its StateInfo which stores its parent State.\n\nThe original implementation also stores the destination state as mDestState \u003d (State) destState",
      "parentUuid": "242db3dc_7eee722b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1278,
        "startChar": 65,
        "endLine": 1278,
        "endChar": 75
      },
      "revId": "a283c12512af5783ff7876d2ef76a681e886ea55",
