      "writtenOn": "2019-06-07T14:01:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s extremely unlikely anyone is passing null here, but because this is internal you can just check if that can ever happen by looking at all invocations of this method. If you find that null is never passed, then disallow it and make it @NonNull, because indeed it makes very little sense.",
